    <string name="member_faq_a5">You can pay via Mada, Apple Pay, or credit/debit card. Saved cards are supported for faster checkout.</string>
    <string name="member_faq_q6">How do I contact my provider?</string>
    <string name="member_faq_a6">Once an order is placed you can message the provider directly through the in-app chat at any time.</string>
